{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "571a2a9c19ffa0a363e7405081a497441af8d06300a20f0d5975ada2e01139ae", "ja": "最強ダンスユニット誕生？", "zh": "最强舞团诞生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b3515e96274762b1dbaee9a5e06be1b6f4f4b4f1c2489be56780918b788fd51c", "ja": "ダンスに手応えを感じる歩と真に、本格的な\nダンスユニットも夢じゃないと言うプロデュ\nーサー。可奈と雪歩は自信が持てなかったが\nとにかく頑張ってみると宣言する。けれどそ\nれは、ちょっとヤケ気味のようで……。", "zh": "步与真在舞蹈方面得心应手，\n制作人表示想组成真正的舞团也不是梦。\n可奈与雪步虽然对此没有信心，\n仍旧表明自己会试着努力。\n然而她们看起来却有些自暴自弃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "917c97305b341b36815cc7e564e7844202aa7232de2989f1b5e9e15164342a32", "ja": "（今日は、BIRTHのレッスン初日。\n全体曲のダンスは……うん、うまくいってるようだな）", "zh": "（今天是『BIRTH』第一天训练。\n全体合唱曲的舞蹈……嗯，似乎进展得很顺利。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9448cf921f21a3ded67fe7aaef75f693fe11cd93983d028b8c8fcda236f70803", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま！\nいったん休憩にしようか。", "zh": "大家辛苦了！\n先休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fb12d317a823e6babd43c3a6dbf2917ba772d589c875721401eb192b5ff06b9b", "ja": "オッケー！　手応えは十分、ってカンジだな！\n真、今のダンス、いい感じだったよね？", "zh": "OK！感觉跳得非常得心应手呢！\n真，刚才的舞蹈感觉很棒对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "542714bfab87bebee03d8474027990d583570e66a10a167fa9166c821ef099f0", "ja": "うん、バッチリ！\n歩とダンスすると、すごく楽しいし刺激になるよ！", "zh": "嗯，非常棒！\n跟步一起跳舞非常开心，而且是很好的刺激喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b0c661b20cf98962109c79010d3ac97dd42dd4b38b84b39b2ba0595056d32a3c", "ja": "真に改めて言われると、なんか照れるな～。\nでも、嬉しいよ！", "zh": "你这样特地拿出来说，听了好害羞喔～\n但我很高兴喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1005_004yuk", "source_sha256": "fc2e96416d2cc273f4dfd5816e27b59afd3a7bc5ec74ca9dd1ba650c4932d084", "ja": "真ちゃんと歩ちゃん、息ぴったりだったよ。\n私、思わず見とれちゃった……。", "zh": "小真跟小步真是默契十足耶。\n我都不禁看得入迷了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1006_036kan", "source_sha256": "b4faf7a60f40ad174dfd744237b84a3b3b6a7be1906e314c3319ca3e1b6c1cca", "ja": "そうですよねっ、ふたりともすっ…ごくカッコよくて！\nダンスユニットみたいでした！", "zh": "就是说呀，两位都非……常帅气！\n简直就像是舞团！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1007_p", "source_sha256": "02debe508f0b7830f4da6400b103b8d9d75dffd70e60473d8da82a43c3b675c3", "ja": "そうだな。真と歩のふたりなら、\n本格的なダンスユニットも夢じゃないかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊，如果是真跟步两个人的话，\n要组成真正的舞团可能也不是梦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1008_006mak", "source_sha256": "35f136ed78d88e180b68d88b3bab8bb01c01e7e6e43756642060b3079d55f154", "ja": "ダンスユニットかぁ……。", "zh": "舞团吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6843e3cea82da00fc3b017ffcc4651a794e9be3852069785dde45d0be9e997cf", "ja": "それならさ、BIRTHのみんなで、最強の\nダンスユニットを目指すっていうのはどうかな？", "zh": "既然这样，就让我们『BIRTH』全员，\n一起以最强舞团为目标怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "365ee9776456bab6c5a86bb9d3ad4c1caaf3bc5d08d1b604afd088984fed6b3a", "ja": "えっ！？　最強のダンスユニットって……\nわ、私たちもですかぁ！？", "zh": "咦！？最强舞团……\n也、也包括我们吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "477edf792a83498e18084f32964b5a75673a55ee976e311e851c44405f5926e2", "ja": "ん～……でも、真ちゃんや歩ちゃんみたいな\nカッコいいダンスが、私にできるかしら……？", "zh": "唔……但是，我能像小真跟小步一样，\n跳出那么帅气的舞蹈吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "fc06754053cf48e62e0ea73a0b29f882a043703d417e095806094f819a448ef6", "ja": "あずささんなら大丈夫ですよ、ボクが保証します！\n何だったら、手取り足取り、教えちゃいますから！", "zh": "阿梓姊一定没问题，在下可以保证！\n不然在下还可以无微不至地教你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "c89fc171cbde1260408d02900449415a85d60eefbd5efd404cfdf459bd425e83", "ja": "真ちゃん、頼もしいわね～。うふふっ。\nそう言ってもらえるなら、安心だわ。", "zh": "小真好可靠～唔呵呵。\n听你这么说，我就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "dba67d56b769c87182ac65c30565500dfbf8f6dfc4d8016e005d59dd83d43970", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、どう思いますか？\nユニットの方向性……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生的看法呢？\n关于团体的路线……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "39b65057e16fc40f9384bc38876874012d06c88589a5e6f6a6ff4d890f2abe04", "ja": "うーん、みんながやりたいなら構いませんけど……\n可奈と雪歩はどうだ？　やってみたいか？", "zh": "嗯～如果大家都想朝这个方向走是没关系……\n但可奈跟雪步觉得怎么样？你们想试试看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "1cd2bf898168e73afb61d47a49ea2050a2e4e756aa8a41af149333a0f2510f81", "ja": "さ、最強のダンスユニットを、私たちが……？", "zh": "要、要我们朝最强舞团迈进……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1018_036kan", "source_sha256": "af2432f206e1b0bdc78b75fd581a40bd25e1953d98f79509b99c4c303516c6b9", "ja": "（ど、どどど、どうしよう～っ！？\n最強のダンスユニットなんて、私には無理だよ～っ！）", "zh": "（怎、怎怎怎、怎么办～！？\n我根本不是最强舞团的料啊～！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1019_036kan", "source_sha256": "6c52b2d7da8e8db0fbb8f54ef65587ffe198f7d3ab2c698915dd13ed95547345", "ja": "（でも、真さんもあずささんもノリノリだし……。\n私ひとりが『できません！』なんて……）", "zh": "（但是真跟阿梓姊都跃跃欲试……\n只有我一个人说『做不到！』也太……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1020_036kan", "source_sha256": "d9be2ca92e4e4c39e2ca6a57ccac119fd60699ebdcdccb39221ea0e2f9f0886a", "ja": "（あっ、そうだ雪歩さん！　雪歩さんが、\nもしかしたら断ってくれるかも！？）", "zh": "（啊，对了，雪步！\n雪步说不定会帮忙婉拒！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1021_036kan", "source_sha256": "2b001e0083d861408546fa37acfd7ef9dfcfcaa4a6b779c9e60f046f769b420f", "ja": "じーっ……。", "zh": "（盯）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1022_004yuk", "source_sha256": "396b61c7aa835410ba9b50251adc82e06e30b88e63fa2f43e792965c701ebf6e", "ja": "……はっ！？", "zh": "……啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1023_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ea4324d11110d698a500477839e3bd15a873a4ffeec804e23b47c7c8515c6e35", "ja": "（か、可奈ちゃんに見られてる……。うう、つまり\n『ダンスユニットやりましょう！』ってことだよね？）", "zh": "（可、可奈在看我……呜呜，\n意思就是『让我们朝舞团迈进！』对吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1024_004yuk", "source_sha256": "62bb97662c5ffe22557311e767702f4172f8f7be3b0bcd64674c12815a81788c", "ja": "（そうだよね……。自信は1ミリもないけど、\n先輩として、私も頑張らなくちゃ……！）", "zh": "（也对……虽然我一点信心都没有，\n但我这个前辈也要加油才行……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1025_004yuk", "source_sha256": "711e4503029ef26bbfbb1d6cd311bda44ecde48dc216fab59796d68f8fa7a256", "ja": "（真ちゃんもあずささんも、すごくやる気だし。\nみんなに置いていかれないようにしないと……！）", "zh": "（小真跟阿梓姊也非常有干劲，\n我必须努力跟上大家的脚步……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1026_004yuk", "source_sha256": "80b93b4f14c8db230e11e91544c75dd640032ac4822ae7d45b40345565aea1d2", "ja": "う、うぅ……。", "zh": "唔、唔唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "dc499c36da5f507092ebda12c74d18491e5bf7453c5faf58fa468b8c1ef14bef", "ja": "雪歩ちゃん？", "zh": "雪步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "607c64d3fcc75afa0236774144880010ef2bc8b31e2669e0e134980be5895616", "ja": "わ、わかりましたぁ！\n最強ダンスユニット、私もやります～っ！", "zh": "我、我知道了！\n我也要朝最强舞团迈进～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1029_036kan", "source_sha256": "5c5b8dee5e89384caa4e0e5a70e50190d0904020dce3b90f7ea4918478ab752c", "ja": "ええっ！？　や、やるんですか雪歩さん！\n最強ダンスユニットですよぉ！？", "zh": "什么！？你、你确定吗，雪步！\n是最强舞团喔！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1030_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c5eaf11dd64b2d68fd8c7e270f81d6922c0ae2264c9a399402b73c66e150c9cd", "ja": "う、うん。だって可奈ちゃんもやる気だし、\nだったら私も、負けないように……頑張るね！", "zh": "没、没错。因为可奈也充满干劲，\n既然这样我也不能输……我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1031_036kan", "source_sha256": "7a023387e438ae2d1bf1f587c8d9d5fac11c884d99fe74431b3624c7dab8eebc", "ja": "えええええっ！？　わ、私！？", "zh": "咦咦咦咦咦！？我、我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3be28fac15a81c9b40f5c625330f5b643cd965799bc2e1bd1121efbc1e45cacb", "ja": "さっすが、雪歩♪\nよしっ！　可奈、アタシ達も一緒に頑張ろうな！", "zh": "不愧是雪步♪\n好！可奈，我们也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1033_036kan", "source_sha256": "b78805b296afd5d6f5111c4d4de428788be64499acefd1435a99e0fa3faff553", "ja": "あ、歩さん……私……私……。", "zh": "步、步姊……我……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1034_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2b001e0083d861408546fa37acfd7ef9dfcfcaa4a6b779c9e60f046f769b420f", "ja": "じーっ……。", "zh": "（盯）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1035_036kan", "source_sha256": "d67fe093f0301963012c9607941758083a9090c7fb75f913d3f21364ada89362", "ja": "わ…………私も、が、頑張りますぅ～～～っ！", "zh": "我…………我也会努、努力加油～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "2397727cc646bb7650e5506b32a64b9a743a9c2d965fbf6c4535454c1e1ade98", "ja": "よし、ひとまずユニットの方向性は決まりだね。\n{$P$}、これでいきます！", "zh": "好，那团体路线就先这样决定啰。\n{$P$}，我们要朝这个方向前进！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1037_p", "source_sha256": "70bd810ba0e2cd1638374d66cabdc47d2d5a0f3e5b5fa643e0e730928e217c54", "ja": "う、うん……そうか。\nみんながいいなら、いいんだけど……。", "zh": "好、好的……这样啊。\n既然大家都同意就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1038_010azu", "source_sha256": "f65d4f76ebb1694ead05524454cd92a85d0a3e3f5c0b06f7b2fef90eb55324fa", "ja": "雪歩ちゃん、可奈ちゃん、心配しなくても大丈夫よ。\n私だって、ダンスはそんなに得意じゃないけれど……。", "zh": "雪步、可奈，你们不用担心。\n我也不是那么擅长跳舞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "80262ec48f25e0709bf1a94ffc2f70369eac88e34dd7d764e94f628783e1ace7", "ja": "真ちゃんと歩ちゃんと、{$P$}さんが\nついていてくれるんだもの。一緒に頑張りましょうね？", "zh": "但还有小真、小步，跟{$P$}先生在。\n我们一起加油好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1040_036kan", "source_sha256": "0ca1997518860d7c6f26e1e42aca9f85907abf76e68aaa209c63135e9c93768c", "ja": "は、はひぃ……！\n……あずささん、キレイ……いい匂い……はうぅ♪", "zh": "好、好的……！\n……阿梓姊真漂亮……身上也好香……啊呜♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1041_004yuk", "source_sha256": "dc8bef65450d6a923e4a27406e8ea7a7917222e60e587a3ad7ee2cde95061c76", "ja": "が、頑張りますぅ～！　はううっ……。", "zh": "我、我会加油的～！啊呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0030_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0030_story_02_1042_p", "source_sha256": "a7f1dabba8d850c2e8a53f0515e9df65e606c50dd24e1f83c2ce4c63874594ad", "ja": "（あずささんはともかく、雪歩と可奈はなんだか\nヤケ気味に見えるな……しばらく、様子を見守るか）", "zh": "（先不说梓小姐，雪步跟可奈看起来有点自暴自弃……\n暂时先观望她们的情况吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
